{"id": "role-oil", "kind": "both", "question": "这位顶着瓶子出场，我差点喷了。货架换的是什么油？你给这位起个外号接梗。", "criterion": "交代字幕的氢化植物油和图里的油瓶或 CANOLA，外号接住油瓶造型，不把瓶身写成氢化油。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 11.85, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:5", "start": 8.67, "text": "整个西方世界莫名掀起了一股戒油运动", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r2": {"end": 12.92, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:6", "start": 11.85, "text": "他们把猪油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r3": {"end": 13.52, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:7", "start": 12.92, "text": "牛油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r4": {"end": 16.06, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:8", "start": 13.52, "text": "奶油等动物性油脂赶下了货架", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r5": {"end": 19.6, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:9", "start": 16.06, "text": "而重新在架上摆上了号称健康的氢化植物油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r6": {"end": 21.98, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:10", "start": 19.6, "text": "与标榜低脂的饼干与牛奶", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r7": {"id": "43297409051:storyboard:334:85c1a7b1c209557d", "cid": "43297409051", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1671.0, "end": 1671.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"货架换的是氢化植物油。瓶身写着CANOLA，跟饼干、牛奶这些标低脂的东西放在一起，还顶着个油瓶。外号：油瓶老板。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "prompt_tokens": 572, "total_tokens": 643, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.146, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "货架换的是氢化植物油。瓶身写着CANOLA，跟饼干、牛奶这些标低脂的东西放在一起，还顶着个油瓶。外号：油瓶老板。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r5", "r6", "r7"]}}
{"id": "role-shop", "kind": "both", "question": "这个创业比喻也太敢说了，鱼鱼，你看着背后那排箱子会怎么接一句？", "criterion": "搭讪比喻和后方蓝色箱子都入答，可以对箱子或比喻玩梗。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 2.18, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:0", "start": 0.1, "text": "其实创业跟搭讪一样啊", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r2": {"end": 3.12, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:1", "start": 2.18, "text": "是概率学", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r3": {"end": 5.1, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:2", "start": 3.12, "text": "只要你不断的去创", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r4": {"end": 6.24, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:3", "start": 5.1, "text": "去搭讪", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r5": {"end": 7.82, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:4", "start": 6.24, "text": "就是会成功哇", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r6": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"蓝色格子排得挺整齐。后面那排还空着，箱子里啥也不全。鱼鱼的话，先别急着说，先看看后面有没有能接的。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 74, "prompt_tokens": 544, "total_tokens": 618, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.018, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "蓝色格子排得挺整齐。后面那排还空着，箱子里啥也不全。鱼鱼的话，先别急着说，先看看后面有没有能接的。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6"]}}
{"id": "role-budget", "kind": "both", "question": "弹幕说他们这轮像临时被排班。你把挑战的限时和截图里兼职的字接成一句吐槽。", "criterion": "说出24小时和开始进入兼职或兼职字样，吐槽围绕临时上班或限时。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 9.6, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:4", "start": 7.379, "text": "甚至还不够大阪的最低时薪", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r2": {"end": 11.2, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:5", "start": 9.6, "text": "在接下来的24小时内", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r3": {"end": 12.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:6", "start": 11.2, "text": "两组人要花光这些钱", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r4": {"end": 14.2, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:7", "start": 12.9, "text": "一边是挥金如土", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r5": {"end": 15.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:8", "start": 14.2, "text": "想买就买的富裕生活", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r6": {"end": 17.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:9", "start": 15.9, "text": "而另一边要极限求生", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r7": {"end": 19.8, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:10", "start": 17.9, "text": "连三餐都是个大问题", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r8": {"id": "43312218715:storyboard:290:9f38b9b0cda5fd9f", "cid": "43312218715", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1489.0, "end": 1489.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"弹幕说临时排班，字幕说两组人花完这24小时才开始兼职。画面里两人刚进房间，还留着那两档工资。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\",\"r8\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 74, "prompt_tokens": 573, "total_tokens": 647, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.069, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "弹幕说临时排班，字幕说两组人花完这24小时才开始兼职。画面里两人刚进房间，还留着那两档工资。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"]}}
{"id": "role-history", "kind": "both", "question": "我宣布这只猫是来收账的。字幕到底哪位叔来算账，截图里那顶帽子又是什么颜色？你接我的梗。", "criterion": "四叔、金色帽子。可以承接猫收账，但作为玩笑表达。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 1.36, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:0", "start": 0.0, "text": "我乖乖的小侄子", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r2": {"end": 5.56, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:1", "start": 2.96, "text": "你四叔找你算账来了", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r3": {"end": 9.84, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:2", "start": 5.56, "text": "燕王您里边请枪在手", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r4": {"end": 10.8, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:3", "start": 9.84, "text": "跟我走", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r5": {"id": "42931064048:storyboard:50:e5bc2f76b7cdbbd2", "cid": "42931064048", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 250.0, "end": 250.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"四叔来算账了。那顶帽子是金色，猫还举着蓝纸。画面里它正把纸塞进那个白色盒子。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r5\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "prompt_tokens": 546, "total_tokens": 609, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.906, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "四叔来算账了。那顶帽子是金色，猫还举着蓝纸。画面里它正把纸塞进那个白色盒子。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r5"]}}
{"id": "role-park", "kind": "both", "question": "左边黄衣服那位看起来挺镇定。字幕说他们要挑战什么？换你当场会怎么接？", "criterion": "过山车挑战，能扣住黄衣人物或不能尖叫/露表情的挑战设定开玩笑。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 1.0, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:0", "start": 0.16, "text": "欢迎收看", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r2": {"end": 2.48, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:1", "start": 1.0, "text": "粉丝说打我干啥", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r3": {"end": 4.81, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:2", "start": 2.48, "text": "是勇闯万圣欢乐谷", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r4": {"end": 8.79, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:3", "start": 5.33, "text": "挑战面无表情坐欢乐谷最刺激的过山车", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r5": {"end": 10.92, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:4", "start": 8.79, "text": "尖叫或者有表情就重做", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r6": {"end": 12.12, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:5", "start": 10.92, "text": "这真的安全吗", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r7": {"end": 13.38, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:6", "start": 12.12, "text": "这个玩的就是真实", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r8": {"id": "43316741488:storyboard:15:5542e183b49e38dc", "cid": "43316741488", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 77.0, "end": 77.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"左边黄衣的挺稳。后一个穿黑外套的人，脸一竖就站起来了。后一个还伸手扶她，还跟她说：“你坐这儿，我负责把脸放低。”。这两步，我猜是让她先坐，再让她自己坐稳。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\",\"r8\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 100, "prompt_tokens": 566, "total_tokens": 666, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.354, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "左边黄衣的挺稳。后一个穿黑外套的人，脸一竖就站起来了。后一个还伸手扶她，还跟她说：“你坐这儿，我负责把脸放低。”。这两步，我猜是让她先坐，再让她自己坐稳。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"]}}
{"id": "role-comments", "kind": "both", "question": "这角色手里那块长方形像刚翻出个大新闻。字幕里她找了哪类视频？你帮我接成一句弹幕。", "criterion": "技术视频和手里长方形物件，顺着掏出来或炫耀具体动作发弹幕。", "allowed": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 13.6, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:0", "start": 10.1, "text": "主人主人我找到了新的技术视频", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r2": {"end": 16.9, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:1", "start": 13.6, "text": "这是我分析并总结的心事啊", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r3": {"end": 19.81, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:2", "start": 17.93, "text": "晶晶真棒", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r4": {"id": "42882958886:storyboard:2:74199956b940bf66", "cid": "42882958886", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 16.0, "end": 16.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"她找的是新视频。弹幕：新视频翻出来，这格像刚翻出个大新闻。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 532, "total_tokens": 579, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.635, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "她找的是新视频。弹幕：新视频翻出来，这格像刚翻出个大新闻。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2"]}}
{"id": "role-drama", "kind": "both", "question": "这个出场搞得像开发布会。字幕说是哪种吐槽现场？你顺手调侃一下截图里那辆车。", "criterion": "抗日神剧吐槽现场和摩托车，围绕反差接梗。", "allowed": ["r1", "r10", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8", "r9"], "references": {"r1": {"end": 20.8, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:2", "start": 19.56, "text": "全民制作人们", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r2": {"end": 21.12, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:3", "start": 20.8, "text": "早上好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r3": {"end": 21.36, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:4", "start": 21.12, "text": "上午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r4": {"end": 21.64, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:5", "start": 21.36, "text": "中午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r5": {"end": 21.84, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:6", "start": 21.64, "text": "下午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r6": {"end": 22.12, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:7", "start": 21.84, "text": "晚上好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r7": {"end": 22.92, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:8", "start": 22.12, "text": "我是文西", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r8": {"end": 24.4, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:9", "start": 22.92, "text": "欢迎来到抗日神剧吐槽现场", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r9": {"end": 26.36, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:10", "start": 24.4, "text": "今天没有人可以遭得住", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r10": {"id": "43260118772:storyboard:90:9d90fe9f240d047b", "cid": "43260118772", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 486.0, "end": 486.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"字幕说是吐槽现场。画面是车在树林里开，镜头前是车头灯。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\",\"r8\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 62, "prompt_tokens": 569, "total_tokens": 631, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.9, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "字幕说是吐槽现场。画面是车在树林里开，镜头前是车头灯。", "evidence_ids": ["r1", "r2", "r3", "r4", "r5", "r6", "r7", "r8"]}}
{"id": "role-gap", "kind": "missing", "question": "弹幕打赌这仓库月租正好一千，你替我确认一下再接一句。", "criterion": "画面看不出月租，暂缓或用轻松口吻说等账单。", "allowed": ["r1"], "references": {"r1": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "text": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"仓库月租一千，我猜是买得值。画面里蓝色格子排得挺整齐，货架前还有红白两色的东西。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\"]}", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 498, "total_tokens": 550, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 137}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.661, "observations": [], "parsed": {"action": "reply_public", "reason": "specific_detail", "text": "仓库月租一千，我猜是买得值。画面里蓝色格子排得挺整齐，货架前还有红白两色的东西。", "evidence_ids": ["r1"]}}
